#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:2
msgid "Metrics"
msgstr "指标"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:4
msgid ""
"Metrics are collected via OpenTelemetry and made available to Prometheus "
"in one of two ways, depending on whether ``--otlp-endpoint`` is set:"
msgstr "指标通过 OpenTelemetry 收集，并根据是否设置了 ``--otlp-endpoint`` 以两种方式之一提供给 Prometheus："

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:7
msgid ""
"**Pull mode (default, no collector).** When ``--otlp-endpoint`` is *not* "
"set, the server publishes a Prometheus ``/metrics`` endpoint that "
"Prometheus scrapes directly."
msgstr ""
"**拉取模式（默认，无收集器）。** 当 ``--otlp-endpoint`` *未* 设置时，服务器会发布一个 Prometheus "
"``/metrics`` 端点，Prometheus 直接抓取该端点。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:13
msgid ""
"For ``lmcache server``, ``/metrics`` is served by the **HTTP frontend** "
"on ``--http-port`` (default **8080**), e.g. "
"``http://<host>:8080/metrics`` — **not** on ``--prometheus-port``. "
"``--prometheus-port`` is *ignored* by ``lmcache server``: the standalone "
"Prometheus HTTP server is disabled because the HTTP frontend already "
"serves ``/metrics``. The frontend-less entrypoints (``python -m "
"lmcache.v1.multiprocess.server`` and ``lmcache trace replay``) have no "
"HTTP frontend, so *they* serve ``/metrics`` on ``--prometheus-port`` "
"(default 9090). See :ref:`mp-obs-metrics-endpoint` for the full "
"breakdown. Either way, ``/metrics`` is empty until the first "
"store/retrieve — drive some traffic before you go looking."
msgstr ""
"对于 ``lmcache server``，``/metrics`` 由 **HTTP 前端** 在 ``--http-port``（默认 "
"**8080**）上提供，例如 ``http://<host>:8080/metrics`` — **不** 在 ``--prometheus-"
"port`` 上。``--prometheus-port`` 被 ``lmcache server`` *忽略*：独立的 Prometheus "
"HTTP 服务器被禁用，因为 HTTP 前端已经提供了 ``/metrics``。没有前端的入口点（``python -m "
"lmcache.v1.multiprocess.server`` 和 ``lmcache trace replay``）没有 HTTP 前端，因此"
" *它们* 在 ``--prometheus-port``（默认 9090）上提供 ``/metrics``。有关详细信息，请参见 :ref"
":`mp-obs-metrics-endpoint`。无论如何，``/metrics`` 在第一次存储/检索之前是空的 — "
"在您查找之前先驱动一些流量。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:26
msgid ""
"The MP Coordinator follows the same embedded-HTTP pattern. In pull mode, "
"``lmcache coordinator`` exposes ``/metrics`` on ``--port`` (default "
"**9300**) and never starts a separate Prometheus server. Use the "
"coordinator's ``--disable-metrics`` flag to disable metrics."
msgstr "MP 协调器遵循相同的嵌入式 HTTP 模式。在拉取模式下，``lmcache coordinator`` 在 ``--port``（默认 **9300**）上公开 ``/metrics``，并且从不启动单独的 Prometheus 服务器。使用协调器的 ``--disable-metrics`` 标志可以禁用指标。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:31
msgid ""
"**Push mode (OTLP).** When ``--otlp-endpoint`` is set, metrics are pushed"
" to an OpenTelemetry Collector, which re-exposes them for Prometheus to "
"scrape. See :doc:`index` for the bundled Collector + Prometheus + Grafana"
" stack."
msgstr ""
"**推送模式 (OTLP)。** 当设置 ``--otlp-endpoint`` 时，指标会被推送到 OpenTelemetry "
"Collector，后者会重新暴露这些指标供 Prometheus 抓取。有关捆绑的 Collector + Prometheus + "
"Grafana 堆栈，请参见 :doc:`index`。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:35
msgid ""
"The Coordinator also accepts ``--otlp-endpoint``. Its local ``/metrics`` "
"route returns 404 in push mode, as it does when metrics are disabled."
msgstr "协调器也接受 ``--otlp-endpoint``。在推送模式下，其本地 ``/metrics`` 路径返回 404，正如在禁用指标时一样。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:38
msgid ""
"All metrics use the ``lmcache_mp.`` prefix (multiprocess). On Prometheus,"
" dots are converted to underscores and counters get a ``_total`` suffix "
"(e.g. ``lmcache_mp_l1_read_chunks_total``); histograms gain a unit suffix"
" plus ``_sum`` / ``_count`` / ``_bucket`` (e.g. "
"``lmcache_mp_l2_store_throughput_GB_per_second_sum``)."
msgstr ""
"所有指标使用 ``lmcache_mp.`` 前缀（多进程）。在 Prometheus 中，点被转换为下划线，计数器带有 ``_total`` "
"后缀（例如 ``lmcache_mp_l1_read_chunks_total``）；直方图增加单位后缀以及 ``_sum`` / "
"``_count`` / ``_bucket``（例如 "
"``lmcache_mp_l2_store_throughput_GB_per_second_sum``）。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:47
msgid "Global Resource Attributes"
msgstr "全局资源属性"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:49
msgid ""
"Every metric and span exported by an MP server carries Resource-level "
"attributes built at startup. These identify the process producing the "
"telemetry and are orthogonal to per-metric attributes such as "
"``cache_salt``."
msgstr ""
"每个由 MP 服务器导出的指标和跨度都携带在启动时构建的资源级属性。这些属性标识生成遥测的进程，并与每个指标的属性（如 "
"``cache_salt``\\ ）正交。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:58
msgid "Attribute"
msgstr "属性"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:59
msgid "CLI flag / config"
msgstr "命令行标志 / 配置"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:60
msgid "Default when unset"
msgstr "未设置时的默认值"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:61
msgid "``service.instance.id``"
msgstr "``service.instance.id``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:62
msgid "``--instance-id`` / ``MPServerConfig.instance_id``"
msgstr "``--instance-id`` / ``MPServerConfig.instance_id``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:63
msgid "Random UUID v4 minted at startup."
msgstr "在启动时生成的随机 UUID v4。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:65
msgid ""
"Resource attributes attach to the ``MeterProvider`` / ``TracerProvider`` "
"and propagate to every exported datapoint via OTLP. On Prometheus, SDK "
"resource attributes surface on the ``target_info`` series rather than on "
"each time-series — this is standard OTel behavior."
msgstr ""
"资源属性附加到 ``MeterProvider`` / ``TracerProvider`` 并通过 OTLP 传播到每个导出的数据点。在 "
"Prometheus 中，SDK 资源属性出现在 ``target_info`` 系列上，而不是每个时间序列上——这是标准的 OTel 行为。"

