#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:205
msgid "Number of per-adapter L2 load requests completed, labeled by adapter type."
msgstr "按适配器类型标记的每个适配器完成的 L2 加载请求数量。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:206
msgid "``lmcache_mp.l2_evicted_objects``"
msgstr "``lmcache_mp.l2_evicted_objects``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:208
msgid "Number of chunks evicted from L2, grouped by tenant."
msgstr "按租户分组的从 L2 逐出的块数量。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:210
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The ``l2_name``-labeled counters (``l2_store_completed`` and "
"``l2_load_completed``) exist so dashboards can compute per-backend IOPS "
"on demand via "
"``rate(lmcache_mp_l2_store_completed_requests_total{l2_name=\"...\"}[1m])``"
" (and the equivalent for loads).  No separate ``*_iops`` metric is "
"exported; keeping the raw counter lets dashboard users pick their own "
"window."
msgstr ""
"``l2_name`` 标签的计数器 (``l2_store_completed`` 和 ``l2_load_completed``) "
"存在的目的是为了让仪表板能够通过 "
"``rate(lmcache_mp_l2_store_completed_requests_total{l2_name=\\\"...\\\"}[1m])``"
" 按需计算每个后端的 IOPS（加载的等效项也是如此）。没有单独导出 ``*_iops`` "
"指标；保留原始计数器让仪表板用户可以选择自己的时间窗口。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:217
msgid "Failure & Health Counters"
msgstr "失败与健康计数器"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:219
msgid ""
"Health-monitoring counters emitted on the dedicated ``lmcache_mp.health``"
" OTel meter. Driven by the ``L1FailureMetricsSubscriber`` and "
"``L2FailureMetricsSubscriber``, which are registered automatically when "
"metrics are enabled. All three counters carry ``model_name`` (extracted "
"from each ``ObjectKey``) so operators can slice per-model on the "
"Prometheus ``/metrics`` endpoint."
msgstr ""
"在专用的 ``lmcache_mp.health`` OTel 计量器上发出的健康监测计数器。由 "
"``L1FailureMetricsSubscriber`` 和 ``L2FailureMetricsSubscriber`` "
"驱动，这两个订阅者在启用指标时会自动注册。所有三个计数器都携带 ``model_name``\\ （从每个 ``ObjectKey`` "
"中提取），以便操作员可以在 Prometheus ``/metrics`` 端点上按模型进行切片。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:233
msgid "``lmcache_mp.l1_allocation_failure``"
msgstr "``lmcache_mp.l1_allocation_failure``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:235
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"L1 memory allocation failures (OOM) during ``reserve_write``. Tagged by "
"``during`` ∈ {``l1_store``, ``l2_prefetch``} to distinguish user-"
"initiated stores from prefetch-triggered allocations, plus "
"``model_name``."
msgstr ""
"在 ``reserve_write`` 期间的 L1 内存分配失败（OOM）。通过 ``during`` ∈ {``l1_store``, "
"``l2_prefetch``} 标记，以区分用户发起的存储与预取触发的分配，以及 ``model_name``\\ 。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:239
msgid "``lmcache_mp.l1_read_failure``"
msgstr "``lmcache_mp.l1_read_failure``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:241
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"L1 ``reserve_read`` failures. Tagged by ``during`` ∈ {``l2_store``, "
"``l1_retrieve``}, ``reason`` ∈ {``not_found``, ``write_locked``}, plus "
"``model_name``. **Post-lookup anomaly counter**, not a cache-miss counter"
" — in MP mode ``reserve_read`` is only called after a successful lookup, "
"so any non-zero value indicates a lookup/reserve race or unexpected "
"eviction and should stay near zero in healthy operation."
msgstr ""
"L1 ``reserve_read`` 失败。标记为 ``during`` ∈ {``l2_store``, "
"``l1_retrieve``}，\\ ``reason`` ∈ {``not_found``, ``write_locked``}，加上 "
"``model_name``\\ 。\\ **后查找异常计数器**\\ ，而非缓存未命中计数器——在 MP 模式下，\\ "
"``reserve_read`` 仅在查找成功后调用，因此任何非零值均表明存在查找/预留竞争或意外逐出，健康运行时该值应接近零。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:248
msgid "``lmcache_mp.l2_prefetch_failure``"
msgstr "``lmcache_mp.l2_prefetch_failure``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:250
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Chunks that L2 reported present at lookup but failed to land in L1. "
"Tagged by ``reason`` ∈ {``l1_oom``, ``not_found``} plus ``model_name``. "
"``l1_oom`` means L1 had no room to receive the prefetched object; "
"``not_found`` means the adapter returned no data despite a positive "
"lookup (e.g. concurrent delete)."
msgstr ""
"L2 报告在查找时存在但未能进入 L1 的块。标记为 ``reason`` ∈ {``l1_oom``, ``not_found``} 以及 "
"``model_name``\\ 。\\ ``l1_oom`` 表示 L1 没有空间接收预取的对象；\\ ``not_found`` "
"表示适配器在查找成功的情况下未返回数据（例如并发删除）。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:256
msgid ""
"A ``reason=serde_failure`` value will be added to ``l2_prefetch_failure``"
" as an additive, non-breaking extension once L2 adapters distinguish "
"deserialization errors from missing objects — no dashboard migration "
"needed when that lands."
msgstr ""
"一旦 L2 适配器区分反序列化错误和缺失对象，将会将 ``reason=serde_failure`` 值作为附加的、非破坏性的扩展添加到 "
"``l2_prefetch_failure`` 中——当这项功能上线时，无需进行仪表板迁移。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:261
msgid ""
"For the full design rationale (including which event types drive each "
"counter and why ``lmcache_instance_id`` is deferred), see "
"``docs/design/v1/mp_observability/METRICS.md`` in the source tree."
msgstr ""
"有关完整的设计原理（包括哪些事件类型驱动每个计数器以及为何推迟 ``lmcache_instance_id``\\ ），请参阅源树中的 "
"``docs/design/v1/mp_observability/METRICS.md``\\ 。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:266
msgid "Lookup Hit-Rate Metrics"
msgstr "查找命中率指标"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:268
msgid ""
"Token-level counters whose ratio gives the fraction of tokens requested "
"by a lookup that were served from either L1 or L2. L0 (GPU prefix cache) "
"is intentionally excluded — it is vLLM-owned and not observable from "
"LMCache."
msgstr ""
"令牌级计数器，其比值表示通过查找请求的令牌中有多少比例是从 L1 或 L2 提供的。L0（GPU 前缀缓存）被有意排除在外——它由 vLLM "
"管理，无法从 LMCache 中观察到。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:279
msgid "``lmcache_mp.lookup_requested``"
msgstr "``lmcache_mp.lookup_requested``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:280
#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:284
#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:288
#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:292
#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:296
#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:300
#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:303
msgid "Counter (attrs: ``model_name``, ``cache_salt``)"
msgstr "计数器（属性：\\ ``model_name``, ``cache_salt``\\ ）"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:281
msgid ""
"Total tokens submitted for lookup (denominator of the L1+L2 token-level "
"hit rate). Only chunk-aligned tokens are counted."
msgstr "提交查找的总令牌数（L1+L2 令牌级命中率的分母）。仅计算与块对齐的令牌。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:283
msgid "``lmcache_mp.lookup_hit``"
msgstr "``lmcache_mp.lookup_hit``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:285
msgid ""
"Total tokens found in L1 or L2 during lookup (numerator of the L1+L2 "
"token-level hit rate). Counts the contiguous prefix hit only."
msgstr "在查找过程中在 L1 或 L2 中找到的总令牌数（L1+L2 令牌级命中率的分子）。仅计算连续前缀命中。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:287
msgid "``lmcache_mp.lookup_hit_l1``"
msgstr "``lmcache_mp.lookup_hit_l1``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:289
msgid ""
"Of ``lookup_hit``: tokens L1 could serve on its own under each object "
"group's attention-window rule."
msgstr "关于 ``lookup_hit``：在每个对象组的注意力窗口规则下，L1 可以独立服务的令牌。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:291
msgid "``lmcache_mp.lookup_hit_l2``"
msgstr "``lmcache_mp.lookup_hit_l2``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:293
msgid ""
"Of ``lookup_hit``: tokens L2 added beyond the L1-servable prefix. ``l1 + "
"l2 == lookup_hit`` per event."
msgstr "关于 ``lookup_hit``：在 L1 可服务前缀之外添加的 L2 令牌。每个事件中 ``l1 + l2 == lookup_hit``。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:295
msgid "``lmcache_mp.lookup_hit_l1_keys``"
msgstr "``lmcache_mp.lookup_hit_l1_keys``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:297
msgid ""
"Hit keys L1 already held. One key per object group, kv rank and chunk, so"
" the count is not divided by the TP world size."
msgstr "L1 中已持有的命中键。每个对象组、KV 排名和块一个键，因此计数不按 TP 世界大小划分。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:299
msgid "``lmcache_mp.lookup_hit_l2_keys``"
msgstr "``lmcache_mp.lookup_hit_l2_keys``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:301
msgid "Hit keys loaded from L2 into L1."
msgstr "从 L2 加载到 L1 的命中键。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:302
msgid "``lmcache_mp.lookups``"
msgstr "``lmcache_mp.lookups``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:304
msgid "Completed lookups (denominator for ``lookup_early_exit``)."
msgstr "完成的查找（``lookup_early_exit`` 的分母）。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:305
msgid "``lmcache_mp.lookup_early_exit``"
msgstr "``lmcache_mp.lookup_early_exit``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:306
msgid "Counter (attrs: ``model_name``, ``cache_salt``, ``reason``)"
msgstr "计数器（属性：``model_name``，``cache_salt``，``reason``）"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:307
msgid ""
"Lookups that exited before a cache probe; ``reason`` is one of "
"``no_gpu_context``, ``empty_chunk_hashes``, ``no_group_layout_descs``."
msgstr "在缓存探测之前退出的查找；``reason`` 是 ``no_gpu_context``、``empty_chunk_hashes``、``no_group_layout_descs`` 之一。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:310
msgid ""
"All lookup counters are driven by the same event "
"(``MP_LOOKUP_PREFETCH_END``), so they always advance together per "
"completed lookup. Early-exit lookups contribute ``0`` tokens to all four "
"token counters, ``0`` keys to both key counters, and ``+1`` to "
"``lookups`` / ``lookup_early_exit``, and abandoned lookups contribute to "
"neither."
msgstr "所有查找计数器由同一个事件（``MP_LOOKUP_PREFETCH_END``）驱动，因此它们在每次完成查找时总是一起增加。提前退出的查找对所有四个令牌计数器贡献 ``0`` 个令牌，对两个键计数器贡献 ``0`` 个键，并对 ``lookups`` / ``lookup_early_exit`` 贡献 ``+1``，而被放弃的查找则不作贡献。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:316
msgid ""
"The ``model_name`` and ``cache_salt`` attributes are captured at lookup "
"time from ``IPCCacheServerKey`` so dashboards can compute per-model or "
"per-tenant hit rate. ``cache_salt`` can be high-cardinality (one entry "
"per tenant or isolation domain); drop it at scrape time with "
"``metric_relabel_configs`` if storage cost matters."
msgstr ""
"``model_name`` 和 ``cache_salt`` 属性在查找时从 ``IPCCacheServerKey`` "
"捕获，以便仪表板计算每个模型或每个租户的命中率。\\ ``cache_salt`` "
"可能具有高基数（每个租户或隔离域一个条目）；若存储成本敏感，请在抓取时通过 ``metric_relabel_configs`` 丢弃它。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:322
msgid "**PromQL for hit rate:**"
msgstr "**PromQL 查询命中率:**"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:347
msgid ""
"**Tokens vs. keys on hybrid models.** The token split credits L1 only "
"with the prefix L1 could serve without L2. On a hybrid model (full "
"attention plus sliding-window or linear-attention layers), L1 may hold "
"every full-attention key while L2 supplies only the few sliding-window "
"keys that complete the prefix. The token counters then report the whole "
"hit as L2, while the key counters show that most of the data came from "
"L1. Use the token counters for \"how much of the hit depends on L2\" and "
"the key counters for \"how much data L2 actually moved\"."
msgstr "**混合模型中的令牌与键。** 令牌拆分仅将前缀 L1 的命中归功于 L1，而 L1 可以在没有 L2 的情况下服务。在混合模型（全注意力加上滑动窗口或线性注意力层）中，L1 可能持有每个全注意力键，而 L2 仅提供完成前缀所需的少量滑动窗口键。令牌计数器报告整个命中为 L2，而键计数器显示大部分数据来自 L1。使用令牌计数器来衡量“命中有多少依赖于 L2”，使用键计数器来衡量“L2 实际移动了多少数据”。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:357
msgid "L0 (GPU) Block Lifecycle Histograms"
msgstr "L0 (GPU) 块生命周期直方图"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:359
msgid ""
"Sampled (default 1%) GPU KV cache block lifecycle tracking via "
"``L0LifecycleSubscriber``. Eviction is detected at reallocation time "
"(when a block is assigned different tokens). Sampling uses random "
"selection with a ``_skipped`` set (bounded by the finite number of "
"physical GPU blocks)."
msgstr ""
"通过 ``L0LifecycleSubscriber`` 采样（默认 1%）GPU KV Cache "
"块生命周期跟踪。在重新分配时检测逐出（当块被分配不同的令牌时）。采样使用带有 ``_skipped`` 集的随机选择（受限于有限数量的物理 GPU"
" 块）。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:365
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"All L0 histograms are emitted with ``instance_id`` and ``model_name`` "
"OTel attributes, enabling per-instance and per-model metric slicing in "
"Prometheus (e.g. "
"``lmcache_mp_l0_block_lifetime_seconds{instance_id=\"12345\",model_name"
"=\"llama-7b\"}``)."
msgstr ""
"所有 L0 直方图都带有 ``instance_id`` 和 ``model_name`` OTel 属性，从而在 Prometheus "
"中实现按实例和按模型的指标切片（例如 "
"``lmcache_mp_l0_block_lifetime_seconds{instance_id=\\\"12345\\\",model_name"
"=\\\"llama-7b\\\"}``\\ ）。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:377
msgid "``lmcache_mp.l0_block_lifetime``"
msgstr "``lmcache_mp.l0_block_lifetime``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:379
msgid "Time from allocation to eviction per sampled GPU block."
msgstr "每个采样的 GPU 块从分配到逐出的时间。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:380
msgid "``lmcache_mp.l0_block_idle_before_evict``"
msgstr "``lmcache_mp.l0_block_idle_before_evict``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:382
msgid "Time from last access to eviction per sampled GPU block."
msgstr "每个采样的 GPU 块从最后访问到逐出的时间。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:383
msgid "``lmcache_mp.l0_block_reuse_gap``"
msgstr "``lmcache_mp.l0_block_reuse_gap``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:385
msgid "Time gaps between consecutive accesses of the same GPU block."
msgstr "同一 GPU 块连续访问之间的时间间隔。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:388
msgid "L0 ↔ L1 Throughput Histograms"
msgstr "L0 ↔ L1 吞吐量直方图"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:390
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Per-request throughput of GPU↔CPU copies via "
"``L0L1ThroughputSubscriber``. Every store/retrieve request contributes "
"one sample to the appropriate histogram: ``total_bytes / (end_ts - "
"start_ts)`` in GB/s. Timestamps come from "
"``MP_{STORE,RETRIEVE}_{START,END}`` events published on the GPU cupy "
"stream, so they reflect true GPU-stream copy time — not Python/lock "
"overhead."
msgstr ""
"每个请求的 GPU↔CPU 复制吞吐量通过 ``L0L1ThroughputSubscriber`` "
"进行统计。每个存储/检索请求为相应的直方图贡献一个样本：\\ ``total_bytes / (end_ts - start_ts)`` 以 "
"GB/s 为单位。时间戳来自在 GPU cupy 流上发布的 ``MP_{STORE,RETRIEVE}_{START,END}`` "
"事件，因此它们反映了真实的 GPU 流复制时间——而不是 Python/锁的开销。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:398
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"All throughput histograms are emitted with ``engine_id`` (vLLM worker "
"instance id), ``device`` (e.g. ``\"cuda:3\"``), and ``model_name`` OTel "
"attributes, enabling per-worker, per-device, and per-model slicing in "
"Prometheus (e.g. "
"``lmcache_mp_l0_l1_store_throughput_GB_per_second{engine_id=\"0\",device=\"cuda:3\",model_name"
"=\"meta-llama/Llama-3.1-8B\"}``)."
msgstr ""
"所有吞吐量直方图都带有 ``engine_id``\\ （vLLM 工作实例 ID）、\\ ``device``\\ （例如 "
"``\"cuda:3\"``\\ ）和 ``model_name`` OTel 属性，从而支持在 Prometheus "
"中按工作者、设备和模型进行切片（例如 "
"``lmcache_mp_l0_l1_store_throughput_GB_per_second{engine_id=\"0\",device=\"cuda:3\",model_name"
"=\"meta-llama/Llama-3.1-8B\"}``\\ ）。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:411
msgid "``lmcache_mp.l0_l1_store_throughput``"
msgstr "``lmcache_mp.l0_l1_store_throughput``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:413
msgid "GPU→CPU (L0→L1) store throughput in GB/s per request."
msgstr "每个请求的 GPU→CPU (L0→L1) 存储吞吐量（单位：GB/s）。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:414
msgid "``lmcache_mp.l0_l1_load_throughput``"
msgstr "``lmcache_mp.l0_l1_load_throughput``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:416
msgid "CPU→GPU (L1→L0) load throughput in GB/s per request."
msgstr "每个请求的 CPU→GPU (L1→L0) 加载吞吐量（GB/s）。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:420
#, python-format
msgid ""
"On the store path the window opens before ``reserve_write`` runs on the "
"CPU, so the store histogram also contains that CPU share. It was measured"
" at well under 1% of the window, so no separate metric or correction is "
"provided."
msgstr "在存储路径上，窗口在 ``reserve_write`` 在 CPU 上运行之前打开，因此存储直方图也包含了该 CPU 的份额。测量结果远低于窗口的 1%，因此没有提供单独的指标或修正。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:428
msgid "Transfer Phase Metrics (gather kernel vs DMA)"
msgstr "传输阶段指标（收集内核与 DMA）"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:430
msgid ""
"The L0↔L1 histograms above give one number per request. A GPU↔CPU "
"transfer, however, is two serialized GPU phases per batch step:"
msgstr "上述 L0↔L1 直方图为每个请求提供一个数字。然而，GPU↔CPU 传输在每个批处理步骤中是两个串行的 GPU 阶段："

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:433
msgid ""
"**kernel** — the gather/scatter kernel moving paged KV blocks ↔ GPU "
"staging buffers (occupies SMs, bounded by GPU memory bandwidth);"
msgstr "**内核** — 移动分页 KV 块 ↔ GPU 暂存缓冲区的聚集/散布内核（占用 SM，受限于显存带宽）；"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:435
msgid ""
"**staging** — the DMA copies moving GPU staging buffers ↔ pinned host "
"memory (occupies copy engines, bounded by PCIe)."
msgstr "**暂存** — DMA 复制将 GPU 暂存缓冲区 ↔ 固定主机内存（占用复制引擎，受限于 PCIe）。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:438
msgid ""
"The native plan executor brackets each phase of each batch step with a "
"pair of CUDA events on the transfer stream (no GPU-side synchronization);"
" when a transfer ends the completed pairs are popped onto the event bus "
"and ``TransferPhaseMetricsSubscriber`` turns them into the metrics below."
" Recording is on whenever metrics or tracing consume the samples and "
"costs nothing otherwise (``--disable-metrics`` without ``--enable-"
"tracing``, or ``--disable-observability``)."
msgstr ""
"本地计划执行器在传输流的每个批处理步骤的每个阶段用一对 CUDA 事件进行括起来（没有 GPU "
"端同步）；当传输结束时，已完成的事件对被推送到事件总线，``TransferPhaseMetricsSubscriber`` "
"将它们转换为以下指标。只要指标或跟踪消耗样本，记录就会开启，否则不消耗任何成本（``--disable-metrics`` 在没有 "
"``--enable-tracing`` 的情况下，或 ``--disable-observability``）。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:446
msgid ""
"There is deliberately **no kernel throughput histogram**: a kernel "
"section's elapsed is mostly the wait for the co-resident inference "
"engine's SMs, so ``bytes / elapsed`` there reports contention, not a "
"transfer rate (full rationale: "
"``docs/design/v1/mp_observability/METRICS.md``)."
msgstr ""
"故意**没有内核吞吐量直方图**：内核部分的经过时间主要是等待共驻推理引擎的 SM，因此``bytes / "
"elapsed``在这里报告的是争用，而不是传输速率（完整理由：``docs/design/v1/mp_observability/METRICS.md``）。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:451
msgid ""
"All three metrics carry ``device_index`` (e.g. ``\"0\"``) and "
"``direction`` (``\"d2h\"`` for stores, ``\"h2d\"`` for retrieves); the "
"two counters additionally carry ``phase`` (``\"kernel\"`` / "
"``\"staging\"``)."
msgstr ""
"所有三个指标都携带 ``device_index``（例如 ``\\\"0\\\"``）和 ``direction``（对于存储为 "
"``\\\"d2h\\\"``，对于检索为 ``\\\"h2d\\\"``）；这两个计数器还额外携带 "
"``phase``（``\\\"kernel\\\"`` / ``\\\"staging\\\"``）。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:462
msgid "``lmcache_mp.transfer_staging_throughput``"
msgstr "``lmcache_mp.transfer_staging_throughput``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:464
msgid "DMA staging throughput in GB/s, one sample per batch step."
msgstr "每批次步骤的 DMA 暂存吞吐量（以 GB/s 为单位），每个样本一个。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:465
msgid "``lmcache_mp.transfer_phase_bytes``"
msgstr "``lmcache_mp.transfer_phase_bytes``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:466
#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:474
msgid "Counter (attr: ``phase``)"
msgstr "计数器（属性：``phase``）"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:467
msgid ""
"Cumulative bytes moved per phase. Kernel-phase bytes are derived from the"
" launches, so blocks skipped via ``skip_prefix_n_blocks`` (sliding "
"windows, partial prefix hits) are not counted as moved; the staging phase"
" counts the whole staged payload. The difference between the two is the "
"payload that crossed PCIe without being consumed by the kernel."
msgstr ""
"每个阶段移动的累计字节数。内核阶段的字节是从启动中得出的，因此通过 ``skip_prefix_n_blocks`` "
"跳过的块（滑动窗口、部分前缀命中）不计入移动；暂存阶段计算整个暂存负载。两者之间的差异是跨越 PCIe 而未被内核消耗的负载。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:473
msgid "``lmcache_mp.transfer_phase_elapsed``"
msgstr "``lmcache_mp.transfer_phase_elapsed``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:475
msgid ""
"Cumulative stream interval per phase: for ``staging`` the DMA itself, for"
" ``kernel`` mostly the wait for the engine's SMs."
msgstr "每个阶段的累积流间隔：对于 ``staging`` 是 DMA 本身，对于 ``kernel`` 主要是等待引擎的 SM。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:478
msgid ""
"**What it answers:** is the DMA side (PCIe / pinned memory) healthy, and "
"where does a slow transfer's time go? Use the counters for aggregate "
"answers, because a mean over per-step histogram samples is not byte-"
"weighted:"
msgstr ""
"**它回答了什么：** DMA 侧（PCIe / "
"固定内存）是否健康，慢速传输的时间去哪里了？使用计数器获取汇总答案，因为逐步直方图样本的平均值不是按字节加权的："

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:499
msgid ""
"A phase's elapsed time is stream-clocked from section start to end, so it"
" includes any stream idle while the CPU enqueues that section's work. "
"Samples are popped when the transfer's ``MP_*_END`` event is dispatched, "
"i.e. shortly after the copy has actually finished on the GPU."
msgstr ""
"一个阶段的经过时间是从部分开始到结束的流时钟计时，因此它包括 CPU 在排队该部分工作时的任何流闲置。当传输的 ``MP_*_END`` "
"事件被调度时，样本被弹出，即在 GPU 上的复制实际完成后不久。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:505
msgid "MP Transfer Counters (in-flight GPU copies)"
msgstr "MP 传输计数器（正在进行的 GPU 复制）"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:507
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Submitted / finished counter pairs for the LMCache-driven GPU transfers, "
"via ``MPTransferCountersSubscriber``. The "
"``MP_{STORE,RETRIEVE}_SUBMITTED`` events are published CPU-synchronously "
"right before a copy is enqueued; the ``MP_{STORE,RETRIEVE}_END`` events "
"are published *from* the GPU cupy stream once the copy has actually run. "
"Subtracting the two gives the number of transfers currently in flight on "
"each GPU."
msgstr ""
"用于通过 ``MPTransferCountersSubscriber`` 进行 LMCache 驱动的 GPU 传输的提交/完成计数器对。 "
"``MP_{STORE,RETRIEVE}_SUBMITTED`` 事件在复制被排队之前以 CPU 同步的方式发布；而 "
"``MP_{STORE,RETRIEVE}_END`` 事件则在复制实际运行后从 GPU cupy 流中发布。将两者相减可以得到每个 GPU "
"上当前正在进行的传输数量。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:514
msgid ""
"All four counters carry exactly one attribute, ``device`` (e.g. "
"``\"cuda:3\"``). This is deliberate: the ``SUBMITTED`` events carry no "
"``engine_id`` or ``model_name``, so labeling the ``END`` side more richly"
" would force a PromQL aggregation to line the two label sets back up "
"before subtracting them. To slice GPU transfer activity by worker or "
"model, use the L0 ↔ L1 throughput histograms or "
"``lmcache_mp.num_chunks_loaded`` instead."
msgstr ""
"所有四个计数器都带有一个属性，``device``（例如``\"cuda:3\"``）。这是故意的：``SUBMITTED``事件不携带``engine_id``或``model_name``，因此更丰富地标记``END``侧将迫使PromQL聚合在减去之前将两个标签集重新对齐。要按工作者或模型切片GPU传输活动，请使用L0"
" ↔ L1吞吐量直方图或``lmcache_mp.num_chunks_loaded``。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:529
msgid "``lmcache_mp.num_submitted_stores``"
msgstr "``lmcache_mp.num_submitted_stores``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:530
#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:534
#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:538
#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:542
msgid "Counter (attr: ``device``)"
msgstr "计数器（属性：``device``）"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:531
msgid ""
"GPU→CPU store transfers enqueued on the device stream, +1 per ``store()``"
" call that reaches the copy."
msgstr "设备流上排队的 GPU→CPU 存储传输，每次达到复制的 ``store()`` 调用 +1。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:533
msgid "``lmcache_mp.num_finished_stores``"
msgstr "``lmcache_mp.num_finished_stores``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:535
msgid "GPU→CPU store transfers completed on the device stream, +1 per completion."
msgstr "设备流上完成的 GPU→CPU 存储传输，每完成一次加 1。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:537
msgid "``lmcache_mp.num_submitted_retrieves``"
msgstr "``lmcache_mp.num_submitted_retrieves``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:539
msgid ""
"CPU→GPU retrieve transfers enqueued on the device stream, +1 per "
"``retrieve()`` call that reaches the copy."
msgstr "设备流上排队的 CPU→GPU 检索传输，每次达到复制的 ``retrieve()`` 调用增加 1。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:541
msgid "``lmcache_mp.num_finished_retrieves``"
msgstr "``lmcache_mp.num_finished_retrieves``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:543
msgid ""
"CPU→GPU retrieve transfers completed on the device stream, +1 per "
"completion."
msgstr "设备流上完成的 CPU→GPU 检索传输，每完成一次加 1。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:546
msgid "**PromQL for in-flight GPU copies:**"
msgstr "**正在进行的 GPU 复制的 PromQL:**"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:562
msgid ""
"**What it answers:** how many GPU KV copies is each device carrying right"
" now? A submitted count that climbs while finished lags means the copy "
"queue is backing up on that GPU; the two tracking together means the "
"device is keeping pace."
msgstr ""
"**它回答了什么：** 每个设备当前正在处理多少个 GPU KV 复制？一个提交的计数在完成延迟时上升，意味着该 GPU "
"的复制队列正在积压；这两个指标一起跟踪意味着设备正在保持步伐。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:569
msgid ""
"\"Finished\" counts a transfer *leaving* the device stream, not its "
"success. A store that committed nothing (``stored_count == 0``) and a "
"retrieve that missed both increment the finished counter. Counting only "
"successes would strand a phantom in-flight transfer in the subtraction "
"forever. Use ``lmcache_mp.num_chunks_loaded`` and the L0 ↔ L1 throughput "
"histograms to measure what actually moved."
msgstr ""
"“完成”计数的是*离开*设备流的传输，而不是其成功与否。一个没有提交任何内容的存储（``stored_count == "
"0``）和一个未命中检索都会增加完成计数器。仅计算成功会导致一个虚幻的在途传输在减法中永远滞留。使用``lmcache_mp.num_chunks_loaded``和L0"
" ↔ L1吞吐量直方图来测量实际移动的内容。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:578
msgid ""
"The derived in-flight retrieve count can drift upward on one fail-closed "
"path. ``retrieve()`` publishes ``MP_RETRIEVE_SUBMITTED`` *before* its "
"block-id underflow check, and that check returns early without publishing"
" ``MP_RETRIEVE_END``, so each request hitting it permanently adds 1 to "
"the difference. That path should never fire in healthy operation and logs"
" at ERROR when it does — an in-flight floor that ratchets up alongside "
"those log lines is the signature, not a stuck GPU. The store path "
"publishes its sentinel *after* the equivalent check and is unaffected."
msgstr ""
"在一个故障关闭的路径上，派生的在途检索计数可能会向上漂移。``retrieve()`` 在其块 ID 下溢检查之前发布 "
"``MP_RETRIEVE_SUBMITTED``，而该检查在没有发布 ``MP_RETRIEVE_END`` "
"的情况下提前返回，因此每个命中它的请求都会永久性地将差值增加 1。该路径在正常操作中不应触发，并且在触发时记录为错误 — "
"与这些日志行一起上升的在途底线是其特征，而不是卡住的 GPU。存储路径在等效检查之后发布其哨兵，并且不受影响。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:589
msgid "L1 ↔ L2 Throughput Histograms"
msgstr "L1 ↔ L2 吞吐量直方图"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:591
msgid ""
"Per-request throughput of L1↔L2 transfers via ``L2ThroughputSubscriber``."
" The store path correlates ``L2_STORE_SUBMITTED`` → "
"``L2_STORE_COMPLETED`` by ``(adapter_index, task_id)``. The load path "
"correlates the per-adapter ``L2_LOAD_TASK_SUBMITTED`` → "
"``L2_LOAD_TASK_COMPLETED`` events by ``(request_id, adapter_index)``; the"
" request-level ``L2_PREFETCH_LOAD_*`` events used by the chunk-count "
"counters aggregate across adapters and cannot be attributed to a specific"
" ``l2_name``."
msgstr ""
"每个请求的 L1↔L2 传输吞吐量通过 ``L2ThroughputSubscriber`` 进行统计。存储路径通过 "
"``(adapter_index, task_id)`` 关联 ``L2_STORE_SUBMITTED`` → "
"``L2_STORE_COMPLETED``\\ 。加载路径通过 ``(request_id, adapter_index)`` 关联每个适配器的"
" ``L2_LOAD_TASK_SUBMITTED`` → ``L2_LOAD_TASK_COMPLETED`` 事件；请求级别的 "
"``L2_PREFETCH_LOAD_*`` 事件用于块计数器在适配器之间进行聚合，无法归因于特定的 ``l2_name``\\ 。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:600
msgid ""
"Timestamps span **submit → complete**, so the duration includes adapter "
"queue, network, and disk I/O — the value is *bytes / end-to-end latency*,"
" not raw transfer rate. Use these histograms to compare adapter types and"
" catch regressions; use the L0↔L1 histograms when you need pure copy-time"
" throughput."
msgstr ""
"时间戳跨度为 **提交 → 完成**\\ ，因此持续时间包括适配器队列、网络和磁盘 I/O — 该值为字节 / "
"端到端延迟，而非原始传输速率。使用这些直方图比较适配器类型并捕捉回归；当您需要纯粹的复制时间吞吐量时，请使用 L0↔L1 直方图。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:606
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"All L1↔L2 throughput histograms carry a single ``l2_name`` OTel attribute"
" — the registered adapter type (e.g. ``\"fs\"``, ``\"nixl_store\"``, "
"``\"mooncake_store\"``) — enabling per-backend slicing in Prometheus "
"(e.g. "
"``lmcache_mp_l2_store_throughput_GB_per_second{l2_name=\"nixl_store\"}``)."
msgstr ""
"所有 L1↔L2 吞吐量直方图都携带一个 ``l2_name`` OTel 属性——注册的适配器类型（例如 ``\\\"fs\\\"``, "
"``\\\"nixl_store\\\"``, ``\\\"mooncake_store\\\"``\\ ）——使得在 Prometheus "
"中能够按后端进行切片（例如 "
"``lmcache_mp_l2_store_throughput_GB_per_second{l2_name=\\\"nixl_store\\\"}``\\"
" ）。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:618
msgid "``lmcache_mp.l2_store_throughput``"
msgstr "``lmcache_mp.l2_store_throughput``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:620
msgid "L1→L2 store throughput in GB/s per request."
msgstr "每个请求的 L1→L2 存储吞吐量（GB/s）。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:621
msgid "``lmcache_mp.l2_load_throughput``"
msgstr "``lmcache_mp.l2_load_throughput``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:623
msgid "L2→L1 load throughput in GB/s per (request, adapter) pair."
msgstr "每对（请求，适配器）的 L2→L1 加载吞吐量（单位：GB/s）。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:625
msgid "**PromQL for average throughput (GB/s), per backend:**"
msgstr "**每个后端的平均吞吐量（单位：GB/s）的 PromQL：**"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:639
msgid ""
"``l2_store_throughput`` populates whenever chunks are written to L2. "
"``l2_load_throughput`` only populates when chunks are read **from L2 into"
" L1** — i.e. on a prefetch load after the entry has aged out of L1. If "
"your working set fits entirely in L1 (common with small models or a large"
" ``--l1-size-gb``), lookups are served from L1 and the load histogram "
"stays empty even though store throughput is non-zero. Drive enough "
"distinct data to force L1 eviction, or restart the server between store "
"and load passes, to exercise the L2 load path."
msgstr ""
"``l2_store_throughput`` 在写入块到 L2 时填充。 ``l2_load_throughput`` 仅在从 L2 读取块到 "
"L1 时填充——即在条目从 L1 逐出后进行的预取加载。如果您的工作集完全适合 L1（在小模型或较大 ``--l1-size-gb`` "
"的情况下很常见），查找将从 L1 提供服务，尽管存储吞吐量非零，但加载直方图将保持为空。驱动足够不同的数据以强制 L1 "
"逐出，或在存储和加载过程之间重启服务器，以测试 L2 加载路径。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:649
msgid "Engine Counters"
msgstr "引擎计数器"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:651
msgid ""
"Worker-scoped counters tied to what the MP server delivers back to each "
"vLLM worker via ``retrieve()``.  Labeled by ``worker_id`` (the vLLM "
"worker instance id) — distinct from any scheduler-scoped id that may "
"appear on other metrics."
msgstr ""
"与 MP 服务器通过 ``retrieve()`` 返回给每个 vLLM 工作线程相关的工作线程范围计数器。以 ``worker_id``\\ "
"（vLLM 工作线程实例 ID）标记——与其他指标中可能出现的任何调度器范围 ID 不同。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:663
msgid "``lmcache_mp.num_chunks_loaded``"
msgstr "``lmcache_mp.num_chunks_loaded``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:664
msgid "Counter (attrs: ``worker_id``, ``model_name``, ``cache_salt``)"
msgstr "计数器（属性：\\ ``worker_id``, ``model_name``, ``cache_salt``\\ ）"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:665
msgid ""
"Total number of LMCache chunks loaded into the engine, summed over all "
"``retrieve()`` completions.  Sliceable per worker, per model, and per "
"tenant / isolation domain (``cache_salt``). ``cache_salt`` may be high-"
"cardinality; drop it at scrape time with ``metric_relabel_configs`` if "
"storage cost matters."
msgstr ""
"加载到引擎的 LMCache 块总数，汇总自所有 ``retrieve()`` 完成结果。可按工作者、模型及租户/隔离域（\\ "
"``cache_salt``\\ ）进行切片。\\ ``cache_salt`` 可能具有高基数；若存储成本敏感，请在抓取时通过 "
"``metric_relabel_configs`` 丢弃它。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:672
msgid "Observable Gauges"
msgstr "可观察仪表"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:674
msgid ""
"Point-in-time state snapshots registered via ``register_gauge`` (pull-"
"based OTel observable gauges)."
msgstr "通过 ``register_gauge`` 注册的即时状态快照（基于拉取的 OTel 可观察仪表）。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:677
msgid ""
"The three in-flight metrics carry two attributes that distinguish "
"adapters even when more than one is registered with the same backend type"
" — same shape as ``lmcache_mp.l2_store_completed``:"
msgstr ""
"这三个正在进行的指标携带两个属性，即使在与相同后端类型注册多个适配器时也能区分它们——与 "
"``lmcache_mp.l2_store_completed`` 具有相同形状："

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:681
msgid ""
"``l2_name`` — the registered adapter type (e.g. ``\"fs\"``, "
"``\"nixl_store\"``, ``\"mooncake_store\"``)."
msgstr ""
"``l2_name`` — 注册的适配器类型（例如 ``\"fs\"``, ``\"nixl_store\"``, "
"``\"mooncake_store\"``\\ ）。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:683
msgid "``adapter_index`` — position in the controller's adapter list."
msgstr "``adapter_index`` — 控制器适配器列表中的位置。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:685
msgid "Adapters with no in-flight work emit no datapoint for that scrape."
msgstr "没有正在进行的工作的适配器不会为该抓取发出数据点。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:694
msgid "``lmcache_mp.active_prefetch_jobs``"
msgstr "``lmcache_mp.active_prefetch_jobs``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:695
#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:699
#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:704
#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:765
#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:769
#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:984
msgid "ObservableGauge"
msgstr "可观察仪表"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:696
msgid ""
"Number of prefetch jobs currently in-flight. A sustained high value may "
"indicate slow L2 backends or polling delays."
msgstr "当前正在进行的预取作业数量。持续的高值可能表示 L2 后端缓慢或轮询延迟。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:698
msgid "``lmcache_mp.l1_memory_usage_bytes``"
msgstr "``lmcache_mp.l1_memory_usage_bytes``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:700
msgid ""
"Bytes currently held in L1.  Rising without plateauing typically "
"indicates a leak; saturating at the configured ``--l1-size-gb`` indicates"
" working set exceeds capacity."
msgstr "当前在 L1 中占用的字节数。持续上升而没有平台期通常表示存在泄漏；在配置的 ``--l1-size-gb`` 达到饱和时表示工作集超过了容量。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:703
msgid "``lmcache_mp.l1_usage_ratio``"
msgstr "``lmcache_mp.l1_usage_ratio``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:705
msgid ""
"L1 used/total ratio (``0.0``–``1.0``), sampled at scrape time from "
"``L1Manager.get_memory_usage()``. Returns ``0.0`` when the gauge target "
"is not yet wired up or ``total_bytes`` is zero, so the callback never "
"raises during a scrape. Compare against the eviction watermark (default "
"``0.8``) to read whether the eviction loop is below or above its trigger "
"threshold."
msgstr ""
"L1 使用/总比率 (``0.0``–``1.0``)，在抓取时从 ``L1Manager.get_memory_usage()`` "
"采样。当仪表目标尚未连接或 ``total_bytes`` 为零时返回 ``0.0``\\ ，因此在抓取期间回调不会触发。与逐出水位线 (默认 "
"``0.8``) 进行比较，以判断逐出循环是否低于或高于触发阈值。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:711
msgid "``lmcache_mp.l2_usage_bytes``"
msgstr "``lmcache_mp.l2_usage_bytes``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:712
msgid "ObservableGauge (attr: ``l2_name``)"
msgstr "可观察仪表 (属性: ``l2_name``)"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:713
msgid ""
"Bytes currently held in each L2 adapter, sampled at scrape time from "
"``adapter.get_usage()``.  One observation per configured adapter, tagged "
"by ``l2_name`` (the adapter type, e.g. ``\"fs\"``, ``\"nixl_store\"``, "
"``\"mooncake_store\"``).  Parallel to ``l1_memory_usage_bytes`` for the "
"L2 tier — use it to see how much each L2 backend currently holds.  "
"Adapters whose ``get_usage()`` raises are skipped silently rather than "
"poisoning the observation, so a missing datapoint for one ``l2_name`` can"
" mean either \"not configured\" or \"adapter errored on this scrape\" — "
"cross-check with the L2 store/load counters."
msgstr ""
"每个 L2 适配器当前持有的字节数，在抓取时从 ``adapter.get_usage()`` 采样。每个已配置的适配器对应一个观测值，通过 "
"``l2_name`` 标记（适配器类型，例如 ``\"fs\"``\\ 、\\ ``\"nixl_store\"``\\ 、\\ "
"``\"mooncake_store\"``\\ ）。它是 L2 层中与 ``l1_memory_usage_bytes`` "
"对应的指标——用于查看每个 L2 后端当前持有多少数据。\\ ``get_usage()`` "
"抛出异常的适配器会被静默跳过，而不会污染观测结果，因此某个 ``l2_name`` "
"缺失数据点可能意味着“未配置”或“该次抓取时适配器发生错误”——请与 L2 存储/加载计数器交叉核对。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:723
msgid "``lmcache_mp.num_inflight_l2_stores``"
msgstr "``lmcache_mp.num_inflight_l2_stores``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:724
#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:729
#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:734
msgid "ObservableGauge (attrs: ``l2_name``, ``adapter_index``)"
msgstr "ObservableGauge (attrs: ``l2_name``, ``adapter_index``)"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:725
msgid ""
"L2 store tasks currently executing, per adapter.  Sustained non-zero "
"values indicate the adapter cannot keep up with the L1 → L2 write rate."
msgstr "每个适配器当前正在执行的 L2 存储任务。 持续的非零值表明适配器无法跟上 L1 → L2 写入速率。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:728
msgid "``lmcache_mp.num_inflight_l2_loads``"
msgstr "``lmcache_mp.num_inflight_l2_loads``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:730
msgid ""
"L2 → L1 prefetch load tasks currently executing, per adapter. Pair with "
"``num_inflight_l2_stores`` to see whether read or write traffic dominates"
" a given backend."
msgstr ""
"每个适配器当前正在执行的 L2 → L1 预取加载任务。与 ``num_inflight_l2_stores`` "
"配对，以查看给定后端是读流量还是写流量占主导。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:733
msgid "``lmcache_mp.inflight_load_memory_usage_bytes``"
msgstr "``lmcache_mp.inflight_load_memory_usage_bytes``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:735
msgid ""
"L1 bytes reserved by in-flight L2 → L1 prefetch loads, per adapter.  "
"Rising in-flight bytes alongside rising ``l1_memory_usage_bytes`` is a "
"signal that prefetch reservations are crowding out cacheable data.  Per-"
"adapter byte attribution follows each request's ``load_plan`` bitmap, so "
"summing across adapters never double-counts."
msgstr ""
"每个适配器由正在进行的 L2 → L1 预取加载所预留的 L1 字节数。若正在进行的字节数与 ``l1_memory_usage_bytes`` "
"同步上升，则表明预取预留正在挤占可缓存数据的空间。每个适配器的字节归属遵循每个请求的 ``load_plan`` "
"位图，因此跨适配器求和时不会重复计数。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:743
msgid "EventBus Self-Monitoring"
msgstr "事件总线自我监控"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:745
msgid ""
"Health metrics for the EventBus itself, registered by "
"``EventBusSelfMetricsSubscriber`` on the ``lmcache.event_bus`` OTel "
"meter.  These metrics observe bus state directly via the ``EventBus`` "
"accessors and report on every OTel scrape — they are not driven by "
"events, so dropping or failing subscribers cannot silence them."
msgstr ""
"EventBus 本身的健康指标，由 ``EventBusSelfMetricsSubscriber`` 在 "
"``lmcache.event_bus`` OTel 计量器上注册。这些指标通过 ``EventBus`` 访问器直接观察总线状态，并在每次 "
"OTel 抓取时报告——它们不是由事件驱动的，因此丢弃或失败的订阅者无法使其静默。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:751
msgid ""
"Use them to answer: is the EventBus keeping up with publishers, is "
"anything being dropped, and are any subscriber callbacks raising? A non-"
"zero ``dropped_events_total`` or a sustained non-zero "
"``drain_lag_seconds`` indicates the bus is at ``--event-bus-queue-size`` "
"and tail-dropping; raise that flag or investigate slow subscribers."
msgstr ""
"使用它们来回答：EventBus 是否能跟上发布者的速度，是否有事件被丢弃，是否有订阅者回调抛出异常？非零的 "
"``dropped_events_total`` 或持续非零的 ``drain_lag_seconds`` 表明总线队列已达 ``--event-"
"bus-queue-size`` 上限并正在进行尾部丢弃；请调大该参数值或排查慢速订阅者。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:764
msgid "``lmcache_mp.event_bus.queue_depth``"
msgstr "``lmcache_mp.event_bus.queue_depth``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:766
msgid "Events currently queued in the EventBus (``len(_queue)`` at scrape time)."
msgstr "事件总线中当前排队的事件（在抓取时的 ``len(_queue)``\\ ）。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:768
msgid "``lmcache_mp.event_bus.drain_lag_seconds``"
msgstr "``lmcache_mp.event_bus.drain_lag_seconds``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:770
msgid ""
"Seconds since the oldest queued event was published; ``0.0`` when empty."
"  Rising values mean the drain thread is falling behind."
msgstr "自最旧的排队事件发布以来的秒数；队列为空时为 ``0.0``\\ 。值持续上升意味着排空线程处理速度跟不上。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:773
msgid "``lmcache_mp.event_bus.dropped_events_total``"
msgstr "``lmcache_mp.event_bus.dropped_events_total``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:774
#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:932
#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:935
#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:1018
msgid "ObservableCounter"
msgstr "可观察计数器"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:775
msgid ""
"Cumulative events dropped because the EventBus queue was at ``--event-"
"bus-queue-size``."
msgstr "因 EventBus 队列达到 ``--event-bus-queue-size`` 而累计丢弃的事件。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:777
msgid "``lmcache_mp.event_bus.subscriber_exceptions``"
msgstr "``lmcache_mp.event_bus.subscriber_exceptions``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:778
msgid "ObservableCounter (attr: ``subscriber_name``)"
msgstr "可观察计数器 (属性: ``subscriber_name``)"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:779
msgid ""
"Cumulative exceptions raised by subscriber callbacks during EventBus "
"dispatch, tagged by ``subscriber_name`` (the failing callback's owning "
"class for bound methods, or ``__qualname__`` for free functions)."
msgstr ""
"由事件总线分发期间由订阅者回调引发的累计异常，按 ``subscriber_name`` 标记（对于绑定方法为失败回调的拥有类，对于自由函数为 "
"``__qualname__``\\ ）。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:784
msgid ""
"For the full design rationale and the in-process accessors that back each"
" metric see ``docs/design/v1/mp_observability/METRICS.md`` and "
"``docs/design/v1/mp_observability/event-bus.md`` in the source tree."
msgstr ""
"有关完整的设计原理以及支持每个指标的进程内访问器，请参阅源代码树中的 "
"``docs/design/v1/mp_observability/METRICS.md`` 和 "
"``docs/design/v1/mp_observability/event-bus.md``\\ 。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:789
#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:811
msgid "gRPC Runtime Metrics"
msgstr "gRPC 运行时指标"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:791
msgid ""
"When metrics are enabled and the MP request transport is gRPC, LMCache "
"also registers gRPC Python's OpenTelemetry observability plugin against "
"the same OTel ``MeterProvider``. ZMQ mode does not register this plugin, "
"so the existing LMCache EventBus metrics remain unchanged. The plugin is "
"provided by ``grpcio-observability`` and is installed only on Linux, "
"which is the platform currently supported by that upstream package. On "
"non-Linux developer hosts the integration is skipped unless the package "
"is available locally. Use ``--disable-grpc-metrics`` to suppress the "
"integration explicitly while keeping LMCache's EventBus metrics enabled."
msgstr ""
"当启用指标且 MP 请求传输为 gRPC 时，LMCache 还会将 gRPC Python 的 OpenTelemetry "
"可观察性插件注册到相同的 OTel ``MeterProvider``。ZMQ 模式不会注册此插件，因此现有的 LMCache EventBus "
"指标保持不变。该插件由 ``grpcio-observability`` 提供，仅在 Linux 上安装，这是当前该上游包支持的平台。在非 "
"Linux 开发主机上，除非本地可用该包，否则将跳过集成。使用 ``--disable-grpc-metrics`` 可以显式抑制集成，同时保持 "
"LMCache 的 EventBus 指标启用。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:801
msgid ""
"The plugin buffers its stats and flushes them from a Python thread, "
"holding the GIL for the whole batch. With the upstream default of 0.5 "
"seconds, each flush can stall requests for several milliseconds under "
"load, so LMCache sets ``GRPC_PYTHON_CENSUS_EXPORT_BATCH_INTERVAL_SECS`` "
"to ``0.05`` unless you have already set it."
msgstr "该插件缓冲其统计信息并从 Python 线程中刷新它们，持有整个批次的 GIL。在上游默认值为 0.5 秒的情况下，每次刷新可能会在负载下使请求停滞几毫秒，因此 LMCache 将 ``GRPC_PYTHON_CENSUS_EXPORT_BATCH_INTERVAL_SECS`` 设置为 ``0.05``，除非您已经设置过该值。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:807
msgid ""
"These metrics describe the gRPC transport itself, not cache hit/miss "
"behavior. They use the upstream ``grpc.*`` namespace. On Prometheus, "
"``.`` is converted to ``_`` and counters get a ``_total`` suffix."
msgstr ""
"这些指标描述的是 gRPC 传输本身，而不是缓存命中/未命中行为。它们使用上游的 ``grpc.*`` 命名空间。在 Prometheus "
"中，``.`` 被转换为 ``_``，计数器会添加 ``_total`` 后缀。"

