"OpenTelemetry Collector 的 Prometheus 导出器。``examples/observability/`` "
"中捆绑的堆栈为您配置了这一点 — 请参阅 :doc:`index`。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:872
msgid "Coordinator Metrics"
msgstr "协调器指标"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:874
msgid ""
"Coordinator metrics use the ``lmcache_coordinator.`` prefix, so a series'"
" origin is clear from its name even when the coordinator and the MP "
"servers share one Prometheus.  The coordinator's resource carries "
"``service.name=lmcache-mp-coordinator`` and ``service.instance.id`` set "
"to the host name (the pod name under Kubernetes)."
msgstr ""
"协调器指标使用 ``lmcache_coordinator.`` 前缀，因此即使协调器和 MP 服务器共享一个 "
"Prometheus，系列的来源也可以从其名称中清楚地看出。协调器的资源携带 ``service.name=lmcache-mp-"
"coordinator`` 和 ``service.instance.id`` 设置为主机名（Kubernetes 下的 pod 名称）。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:880
msgid ""
"The Key Directory gauges always emit one observation for each ``tier`` "
"value, ``l1`` and ``l2``, including zero-valued observations for an empty"
" tier.  A placement is one place a key is stored: L1 on one server, or "
"one L2 backend. Placement bytes are the sum of the logical object sizes "
"reported for those placements, not unique-object bytes, physical "
"allocation, or storage capacity. The same object is therefore included "
"once for every placement recorded for it."
msgstr ""
"Key Directory 指标始终为每个 ``tier`` 值（``l1`` 和 "
"``l2``）发出一个观测值，包括空层的零值观测。一个放置是一个键存储的位置：在一台服务器上的 L1，或一个 L2 "
"后端。放置字节是为这些放置报告的逻辑对象大小的总和，而不是唯一对象字节、物理分配或存储容量。因此，同一对象在为其记录的每个放置中都被包含一次。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:895
msgid "``lmcache_coordinator.key_directory.placements``"
msgstr "``lmcache_coordinator.key_directory.placements``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:896
#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:900
msgid "ObservableGauge (attr: ``tier``)"
msgstr "可观察仪表 (属性: ``tier``)"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:897
msgid "Placements currently recorded in the Key Directory for each cache tier."
msgstr "当前在每个缓存层的关键目录中记录的放置情况。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:899
msgid "``lmcache_coordinator.key_directory.placement_bytes``"
msgstr "``lmcache_coordinator.key_directory.placement_bytes``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:901
msgid ""
"Reported logical object bytes summed across the placements currently "
"recorded in each cache tier."
msgstr "报告的逻辑对象字节是当前记录在每个缓存层中的所有放置的总和。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:904
msgid ""
"The same two gauges are also emitted under their previous names, "
"``lmcache_mp.key_directory_placement_count`` and "
"``lmcache_mp.key_directory_placement_size_bytes``, for one release so "
"dashboards can migrate.  The previous names will be removed in the next "
"release."
msgstr ""
"这两个指标在一个版本中也以其之前的名称 ``lmcache_mp.key_directory_placement_count`` 和 "
"``lmcache_mp.key_directory_placement_size_bytes`` "
"被发出，以便仪表板可以迁移。之前的名称将在下一个版本中被移除。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:910
msgid ""
"The ingest metrics say whether the coordinator's view of the fleet is "
"complete.  Two kinds of loss are counted separately: batches that never "
"arrived (a skipped ``seq``), and events an MP server reports it dropped "
"before sending (each batch carries the server's running count in "
"``dropped_events``).  The first batch of a stream the coordinator was not"
" already tracking counts no missing batches: earlier batches were sent "
"before it was listening.  Fleet-wide counters drive alerts; the per-"
"server gauges, one series per ``instance_id`` the coordinator currently "
"tracks, show which server, and cover that server's current run."
msgstr "摄取指标表明协调器对整个集群的视图是否完整。两种损失被单独计算：从未到达的批次（跳过的 ``seq``）和 MP 服务器报告在发送之前丢弃的事件（每个批次携带服务器在 ``dropped_events`` 中的运行计数）。协调器未跟踪的流的第一批次不计算缺失批次：早期批次在其开始监听之前已发送。全局计数器驱动警报；每个服务器的指标，每个 ``instance_id`` 一系列，显示哪个服务器，并覆盖该服务器的当前运行情况。"

