#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:952
msgid "``lmcache_coordinator.ingest.batches_delivered``"
msgstr "``lmcache_coordinator.ingest.batches_delivered``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:953
#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:956
msgid "ObservableCounter (attr: ``consumer``)"
msgstr "可观察计数器（属性：``consumer``）"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:954
msgid "Admitted batches handed to each view or controller."
msgstr "每个视图或控制器接收的已接纳批次。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:955
msgid "``lmcache_coordinator.ingest.batch_apply_time_seconds``"
msgstr "``lmcache_coordinator.ingest.batch_apply_time_seconds``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:957
msgid ""
"Time each view or controller spent applying those batches.  Divide its "
"rate by the rate of ``batches_delivered`` for the average apply time per "
"batch."
msgstr "每个视图或控制器在应用这些批次上花费的时间。将其速率除以 ``batches_delivered`` 的速率，以获得每个批次的平均应用时间。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:961
msgid "The freshness metrics say how old the coordinator's view is."
msgstr "新鲜度指标表示协调器视图的陈旧程度。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:970
msgid "``lmcache_coordinator.ingest.server_seconds_since_last_event``"
msgstr "``lmcache_coordinator.ingest.server_seconds_since_last_event``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:972
msgid ""
"Seconds since this server's last batch was applied.  High while the "
"server still heartbeats means it has stopped sending events."
msgstr "自上次应用此服务器的批处理以来的秒数。在服务器仍在发送心跳时，如果该值很高，则意味着它已停止发送事件。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:974
msgid "``lmcache_coordinator.ingest.server_event_delivery_delay_seconds``"
msgstr "``lmcache_coordinator.ingest.server_event_delivery_delay_seconds``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:976
msgid ""
"For this server's last applied batch, time from the server sending it to "
"the coordinator applying it.  Measured across the two hosts' clocks, so "
"clock skew shows up here."
msgstr "对于该服务器最后应用的批次，从服务器发送到协调器应用的时间。测量两个主机时钟之间的差异，因此时钟偏差会在这里显示。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:979
msgid "``lmcache_coordinator.kafka.records_read``"
msgstr "``lmcache_coordinator.kafka.records_read``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:981
msgid ""
"Records read from the Kafka topic: ``applied``, ``undecodable`` or "
"``failed``.  Only with ``--event-transport kafka``."
msgstr "从 Kafka 主题读取的记录：``applied``、``undecodable`` 或 ``failed``。仅在使用 ``--event-transport kafka`` 时可用。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:983
msgid "``lmcache_coordinator.kafka.partitions_assigned``"
msgstr "``lmcache_coordinator.kafka.partitions_assigned``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:985
msgid ""
"Topic partitions this coordinator holds.  Fewer than the topic has means "
"another member of the consumer group holds the rest."
msgstr "该协调器持有的主题分区。如果少于主题的分区数量，则意味着消费者组的其他成员持有其余分区。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:987
msgid "``lmcache_coordinator.kafka.unread_records``"
msgstr "``lmcache_coordinator.kafka.unread_records``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:988
msgid "ObservableGauge (attr: ``partition``)"
msgstr "可观察的计量仪表 (属性: ``partition``)"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:989
msgid ""
"Records not yet read per partition.  Kafka's own lag tools cannot report "
"this, because the coordinator never commits offsets."
msgstr "每个分区尚未读取的记录。Kafka 自身的延迟工具无法报告这一点，因为协调器从未提交偏移量。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:992
msgid ""
"The liveness metrics say whether the coordinator's loops and controllers "
"are still doing their work.  A failed pass of a background loop is logged"
" and counted, and the loop keeps running."
msgstr "存活指标表明协调器的循环和控制器是否仍在执行其工作。后台循环的失败执行会被记录和计数，并且循环会继续运行。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:1003
msgid "``lmcache_coordinator.background_loop.last_success_timestamp_seconds``"
msgstr "``lmcache_coordinator.background_loop.last_success_timestamp_seconds``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:1004
#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:1009
msgid "ObservableGauge (attr: ``loop``)"
msgstr "可观察的仪表 (属性: ``loop``)"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:1005
msgid ""
"Wall-clock time each loop (``health``, ``checkpoint``, ``eviction``) last"
" finished a pass without an error.  More than three intervals ago means "
"the loop has stopped making progress."
msgstr "每个循环的墙钟时间 (``health``, ``checkpoint``, ``eviction``) 最后一次完成没有错误的传递。超过三个间隔意味着循环已停止进展。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:1008
msgid "``lmcache_coordinator.background_loop.interval_seconds``"
msgstr "``lmcache_coordinator.background_loop.interval_seconds``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:1010
msgid "Configured seconds between the loop's passes."
msgstr "循环执行之间配置的秒数。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:1011
msgid "``lmcache_coordinator.background_loop.passes``"
msgstr "``lmcache_coordinator.background_loop.passes``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:1012
msgid "ObservableCounter (attrs: ``loop``, ``result``)"
msgstr "可观察计数器 (属性: ``loop``, ``result``)"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:1013
msgid "Loop passes, ``ok`` or ``failed``."
msgstr "循环传递，``ok`` 或 ``failed``。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:1014
msgid "``lmcache_coordinator.controller.up``"
msgstr "``lmcache_coordinator.controller.up``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:1015
msgid "ObservableGauge (attr: ``controller``)"
msgstr "可观察的计量仪表 (属性: ``controller``)"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:1016
msgid "``1`` if the controller is running, ``0`` if it failed to start."
msgstr "``1`` 表示控制器正在运行，``0`` 表示启动失败。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:1017
msgid "``lmcache_coordinator.event_loop.blocked_seconds``"
msgstr "``lmcache_coordinator.event_loop.blocked_seconds``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:1019
msgid ""
"Total time the coordinator's event loop was blocked.  Its rate is the "
"fraction of time request handlers, heartbeats and loops were stalled."
msgstr "协调器的事件循环被阻塞的总时间。其速率是请求处理程序、心跳和循环停滞的时间占总时间的比例。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:1021
msgid "``lmcache_coordinator.registry.server_seconds_since_heartbeat``"
msgstr "``lmcache_coordinator.registry.server_seconds_since_heartbeat``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/metrics.rst:1023
msgid "Seconds since each registered server's last heartbeat."
msgstr "每个注册服务器最后一次心跳的秒数。"

